Date: Sun, 11 Oct 2026 14:45:26 -0500
Subject: [PATCH 29/31] ga2: full IPU device
 (IDEC/BDEC/VDEC/FDEC/SETIQ/SETVQ/CSC/PACK), fromIPU DMA and pump

Port of PCSX2's resumable IPU state machine as a self-contained device.
toIPU supports REFE/CNT/NEXT/REF/REFS/END tags. IDEC maps QSC like BDEC
(verified against FFmpeg decodes).
